{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgfvZW43QaqtgbjKnehGu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Basic Memory is set up for this repo. One thing to know: the hook status reports \"checkpoint on compact: off\", though I set `preCompactCapture` to `\"extractive\"`. I didn't look into why.\n\n- **Project:** I used the existing `main` project. Creating a new `ms` project failed because its path would sit inside `main`'s directory, and the only other option was a sibling directory outside `~/basic-memory`.\n- **Session profile:** coding, with repository `ms`. You said to use the directory name since there's no git remote.\n- **Schemas:** I seeded Coding Session, Decision and Task into `main`. None existed before. The seeded `schemas/Coding Session.md` has its `schema` fields in the frontmatter as nested objects, not as the `'[object Object]'` string the skill warns about. I only read that one note back.\n- **Placement:** the project is empty, so I suggested a light starting layout: `sessions/`, `decisions/`, `tasks/`, `reference/` and `bm-remember/`. It's stored in the settings, and no folders were created.\n- **Smoke test:** the open-decision query ran cleanly with 0 results, and the schema query returned all 3 schemas.\n- **Hook status:** it found the settings for `ms`, with `main` as the primary project and capture events on. There is 1 pending envelope in the shared inbox, 0 archived, and it has never been flushed.\n- **Output style:** `basic-memory` is on.\n- **Shared skills:** I installed the `memory-*` skills globally with `npx skills add`.\n- **Settings file:** I wrote the settings to `.claude/settings.local.json`, so they're personal, not a team default. That file isn't gitignored, so it will show as untracked in `git status`. Add it to `.gitignore` or `.git/info/exclude` if you don't want to commit it.\n\nRestart the session to turn on the proactive-capture reflexes. Recall and the pre-compact checkpoint are already live this session.\n\nDone — I'll use this from the next message. Run `/basic-memory:bm-status` anytime to see what I'm tracking."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":649,"cache_read_input_tokens":37975,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":649},"output_tokens":697,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bf5361a1-c699-4da2-b58b-a974f8e0a24f","uuid":"1409ca42-dd27-4b3b-91cc-305529e537e3","timestamp":"2026-11-03T11:34:55.804Z","request_id":"req_011CgfvZVursiMji6eAJj6EK"}
